  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay warm and comfortable while on duty with our MA-1 Flight Jacket with Security Print. The uniform jacket features lightweight poly fiberfill for exceptional insulation and a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow, perfect for cold and wet days while on patrol.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
