  "description": "<p>Stay warm and comfortable while on duty with our MA-1 Flight Jacket with Security Print. The uniform jacket features lightweight poly fiberfill for exceptional insulation and a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow, perfect for cold and wet days while on patrol. Duty Ready: The security jacket features bold &ldquo;SECURITY&rdquo; lettering on the left chest and back for easy identification. The uniform flight jacket is great for security guards, public safety, bouncers, and more. Unbeatable Comfort and Warmth: These security bomber jackets feature a soft ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband for additional heat retention and insulation while blocking out the wind. The MA-1 security jacket has an extra full cut for a comfortable fit with room underneath for extra layers, ideal for winter and cold weather. Utility Pockets: The outdoor uniform coat comes equipped with 5 pockets: 2 front slash pockets and 2 inner welt pockets for everyday essentials, and what&rsquo;s a bomber jacket without a zippered utility sleeve pocket!? Along with exterior pen holders, this useful pocket is great for storing small items. Legendary MA-1 Silhouette: Inspired by the original design for fighter pilots, our rugged and dependable MA-1 Flight Jackets feature a reversible orange polyester lining that offers alternative style options. The zippered front closure with double &lsquo;MA-1&rsquo; pull tabs and storm flap, brass zippers, and leather pull tab pays homage to the jacket&rsquo;s heritage, functionality, and style.</p>",
